msgstr "Usaches %1$d dos teus %2$d correos electrónicos gratuítos de SendLayer. <a href=\"%3$s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Actualiza o teu plan</a> para que os teus correos electrónicos se sigan enviando sen interrupcións."

#. translators: %1$s - SendLayer dashboard URL; %2$s - custom domain
#. documentation URL.
#: src/Providers/Sendlayer/QuickConnectUsage.php:519
msgid "You're sending through a shared SendLayer domain. For better deliverability, add your own domain on the <a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SendLayer dashboard</a> and follow our <a href=\"%2$s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">custom domain guide</a>."
