#: src/Providers/Sendlayer/QuickConnect.php:516
msgid "SendLayer is now set up as your Backup Connection. Emails that fail to send with your primary connection will be sent via SendLayer."
msgstr "SendLayer está agora configurado como a túa conexión de respaldo. Os correos electrónicos que non se consigan enviar coa túa conexión principal enviaranse mediante SendLayer."

